<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Showers seen in central parts of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Showers seen in central parts of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Tuesday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   10.6</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    3.6</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   73.3</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecast thundershowers in the Central, Uva and North Central provinces during the afternoon or evening on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
